CreateAthleteConnectionInviteRequest.description:
Represents a single connection invite to be created during a sync operation.
The requesting athlete provides the granting athlete's email address;
the API resolves it to an athlete ID server-side.

trainingGroupId.description:
The training group this workout is scheduled for. Non-null on group-targeted rows;
null on personal-scheduling rows. Group rows always come back with
FitEpic.Api.Models.Response.ScheduledWorkoutResponse.IsLocked = `true`.

streakAndDayCountStartDate.description:
The date the athlete wants their streak / "X out of Y days" tracking history to begin
from. Must not be in the future. Omit to leave unchanged; send `null` to clear;
send a value to set.
